 you can get all the fat stuff instead, but I need to try to be good at lunch time. They also have tortilla soup and black bean soup every day which makes me very happy. They have huge Mexican combo plates with tacos, bur..."},{"business_id":"zB3uv3AJcNUqndw1G96Ziw","review_id":"Ft2aQ5wMVe2O9DovZ3tUug","date":"2020-02-20T19:07:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9452559351921082,"text_excerpt":"I haven't been to this place in a very long time. And has still not disappeared me yet! It's located in the Place St Charles building on the second floor's small food court area. I ordered a taco salad with grilled shrimp, and it's the best one I've had in quite some time. I'm definitely coming back if I'm in the area."},{"business_id":"zB3uv3AJcNUqndw1G96Ziw","review_id":"r0QmbDYKWcnwpo9mGbT0mQ","date":"2011-03-29T15:33:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9392621517181396,"text_excerpt":"This place is a great spot for lunch only. Try the taco salad or the nachos, they are authentic and very taste. Stuff with all your favorites. Their friendly staff is top notch."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
